"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"policyRegistry\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"contract IPolicyRegistryView\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"market\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"token\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"registerToken\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"configurator\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"authorized\",\"type\":\"bool\"}],\"name\":\"setAuthorizedConfigurator\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"newOwner\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"transferOwner\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"}],\"devdoc\":{\"details\":\"Mirrors ERC3643ComplianceAdapter.sol structure with one key difference:      policy lookup is self-configuring from the B20 token \\u2014 no off-chain coordination.      - IComplianceAdapter.configure(address market) takes ONE arg per spec (IComplianceAdapter.sol:26).        Token binding comes via separate factory-admin registerToken(market, token) call,        same two-step pattern as ERC3643ComplianceAdapter.registerToken and ChainlinkEquityFeedAdapter.registerFeed.      - policyId == 0 is the always-allow builtin sentinel \\u2192 skip check.      - Registry address is constructor param (multi-chain + testability), not hardcoded constant.      - Checked at origination (always when complianceAdapter != 0) and on TransferablePosition transfers        per Validation Matrix R5 \\u2014 note R5 is off-chain review-enforced (MarketFactoryV2.sol:332-340).      - FAIL-CLOSED: any revert \\u2192 false (engine treats revert as false). Multi-tenancy: factory calls configure() once per market; admin calls registerToken() to bind token.\",\"kind\":\"dev\",\"methods\":{\"configure(address)\":{\"params\":{\"market\":\"Address of the LendingMarket contract\"}},\"isEligible(address)\":{\"details\":\"Returns false on any error (fail-closed). The engine never      fails open on an unexpected revert from this adapter.\",\"params\":{\"participant\":\"Address to check eligibility for\"},\"returns\":{\"_0\":\"eligible True if the participant passes all compliance checks\"}},\"registerToken(address,address)\":{\"params\":{\"market\":\"LendingMarketV2 address\",\"token\":\"B20 collateral token address\"}}},\"title\":\"B20PolicyComplianceAdapter\",\"version\":1},\"userdoc\":{\"kind\":\"user\",\"methods\":{\"configure(address)\":{\"notice\":\"Configure the adapter for a specific market\"},\"getMarketPolicies(address)\":{\"notice\":\"View helper for UI: returns the two policyIds for a market\"},\"isEligible(address)\":{\"notice\":\"Check if a participant is eligible to borrow or hold a position\"},\"registerToken(address,address)\":{\"notice\":\"Bind a B20 token to a market for policy checks (factory only)\"}},\"notice\":\"Multi-tenant compliance adapter for Base B20 tokenized stocks\",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"src/adapters/rwa/B20PolicyComplianceAdapter.sol\":\"B20PolicyComplianceAdapter\"},\"evmVersion\":\"paris\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\"},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":true,\"runs\":200},\"remappings\":[\":@chainlink/=node_modules/@chainlink/\",\":@eth-optimism/=node_modules/@eth-optimism/\",\":@openzeppelin/=node_modules/@openzeppelin/\",\":@uniswap/=node_modules/@uniswap/\",\":base64-sol/=node_modules/base64-sol/\",\":eth-gas-reporter/=node_modules/eth-gas-reporter/\",\":forge-std/=lib/forge-std/src/\",\":hardhat/=node_modules/hardhat/\"],\"viaIR\":true},\"sources\":{\"src/adapters/rwa/B20PolicyComplianceAdapter.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0x2f2cf18772e73e5464088f71d54b967a1f6ca3f0834f4d5fba47c14554113337\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://f1